5000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z"}},{"thread_id":"7f897596-1a87-4cb5-8d63-16ec9cf5050f","client_message_id":"d977ee7e-b3bf-416e-8aac-1ec3845823f2","block":{"tool_call_id":"call_00_bpquSByHlL8yZRvKGxbs4054","id":"3F51A015-6938-59B4-97F1-FA5640CBC9EC","revision":1779337363348065,"kind":"tool","updated_at":"2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。","name":"generate_structured_health_card"}}},"node_role":"tool","status":"ready","order_key":2000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z"}},{"thread_id":"7f897596-1a87-4cb5-8d63-16ec9cf5050f","client_message_id":"d977ee7e-b3bf-416e-8aac-1ec3845823f2","block":{"tool_call_id":"call_01_9G38kjBbwI7XUMyfI4JM6567","id":"F1AD2014-C33D-5D7A-A86A-02D2B2FDDA3E","revision":1779337363374504,"kind":"tool","updated_at":"2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。","name":"generate_structured_health_card"}}},"node_role":"tool","status":"ready","order_key":4000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z"}},{"thread_id":"ac2e6a08-a3dc-40e1-ad3c-2cf622b9227f","client_message_id":"58eaa694-b499-4516-91c6-b83ee81c5273","block":{"id":"575BF5F4-2950-5590-8B60-8CC49DA2DC6D","revision":1779337621289308,"kind":"text","updated_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:01.000Z","payload":{"text":{"_0":"看起来你遇到的是系统日志，显示 AI 对话请求失败了。让我帮你分析一下：\n\n## 问题分析\n\n从日志来看，关键错误是：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **错误码** | `40402` - `message_not_found` |\n| **失败原因** | 上送对话时找不到对应的消息 |\n| **最终表现** | AI 返回空文本 → 显示「⚠️ 生成内容为空，请重新尝试！」 |\n| **模型** | `deepseek-v4-pro` |\n| **总耗时** | 约 10 秒 |\n\n## 可能的原因\n\n1. **客户端消息 ID 不匹配**：`client_message_id: 69d9a27f-936f-4728-9246-960bbed6acf6` 在服务端找不到对应记录\n2. **会话状态异常**：可能是会话过期、断连后恢复时状态不一致\n3. **消息同步失败**：`outbox 自动上送失败` 说明离线消息队列重试也失败了\n\n## 建议操作\n\n- **刷新页面重试**：清除当前会话状态，重新发起对话\n- **检查网络稳定性**：不稳定的网络可能导致消息同步中断\n- **如果持续出现**：可能是服务端问题，建议稍等片刻再试，或联系平台技术支持\n\n---\n\n另外，我注意到你还没有上传任何健康档案。如果你有体检报告、处方单或病历等需要我帮你整理分析，可以随时上传，我能帮你生成结构化的健康卡片 📋"}},"node_role":"timeline","status":"ready","order_key":1000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:01.000Z"}},{"thread_id":"65db6ffc-c858-4f35-bd3d-351265b4ec3b","client_message_id":"657a20d0-ac33-4924-8474-1f577ad8dbfb","block":{"id":"0AF6F4FE-DED2-5CB0-BB07-C850E12BA04D","revision":1779337645773475,"kind":"text","updated_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z","payload":{"text":{"_0":"已完成胃镜报告和病历卡片的生成。"}},"node_role":"timeline","status":"ready","order_key":5000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z"}},{"thread_id":"65db6ffc-c858-4f35-bd3d-351265b4ec3b","client_message_id":"657a20d0-ac33-4924-8474-1f577ad8dbfb","block":{"tool_call_id":"call_00_l1XG057hJbgVjFN5kLUW6572","id":"E6D3171D-DAD4-51CB-9995-929CF1583051","revision":1779337645774387,"kind":"tool","updated_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。","name":"generate_structured_health_card"}}},"node_role":"tool","status":"ready","order_key":2000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z"}},{"thread_id":"65db6ffc-c858-4f35-bd3d-351265b4ec3b","client_message_id":"657a20d0-ac33-4924-8474-1f577ad8dbfb","block":{"tool_call_id":"call_00_hKPSIWgYLFtPpk4zv27R6115","id":"87E4B4B1-5E36-52A1-9EB3-51270890EF37","revision":1779337645775266,"kind":"tool","updated_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。","name":"generate_structured_health_card"}}},"node_role":"tool","status":"ready","order_key":4000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z"}}]}
