氨基转移酶(AST)\",\"result_value\":\"13.5\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"丙氨酸氨基转移酶(ALT)\",\"result_value\":\"14.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"总蛋白(TP)\",\"result_value\":\"77.0\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"白蛋白(ALB)\",\"result_value\":\"47.4\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"球蛋白(GLOB)\",\"result_value\":\"29.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"白球比(A\\/G)\",\"result_value\":\"1.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"γ-谷氨酰转移酶(GGT)\",\"result_value\":\"19.9\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"碱性磷酸酶(ALP)\",\"result_value\":\"75.9\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"前白蛋白(PA)\",\"result_value\":\"287.0\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"尿素(UREA)\",\"result_value\":\"5.14\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"肌酐(CREA)\",\"result_value\":\"77.50\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"尿酸(UA)\",\"result_value\":\"324.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"胱抑素C(CysC)\",\"result_value\":\"0.76\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血糖\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"葡萄糖(GLU)\",\"result_value\":\"5.42\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"心肌酶\",\"di