INFO 2026-05-21 07:22:50,071 chat_sync.sync [request_id=A3865999-705D-46A0-BB16-FCA8D1F7EDED] chat push payload request_id=A3865999-705D-46A0-BB16-FCA8D1F7EDED user_id=4 content_type=application/json body={"messages":[{"thread_id":"d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2","role":"assistant","model_name":"deepseek-v4-pro","client_message_id":"99608214-b8c3-4895-a6c3-e43823fdc566","delivery_state":"sending","created_at":"2026-05-21 07:22:28.529000+00:00","server_updated_at":"2026-05-21 07:22:49.317000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"deepseek-v4-pro","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":14096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","blocks":[{"updated_at":"2026-05-21T07:22:49.309Z","status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-21T07:22:49.286Z","node_role":"timeline","id":"40554A0D-F26E-5974-BB5D-3E7081C361AE","order_key":900,"kind":"deepThought","revision":1779348169309341,"payload":{"deep_thought":{"_0":{"reasoning_content":"用户问\"主要参数是什么\"，这是在刚才生成的检验报告卡片基础上追问的。我需要从刚才的报告中提炼出关键的参数信息。\n\n让我回顾一下报告中的核心指标：\n\n1. 白细胞系统 - WBC、中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、hs-CRP\n2. 红细胞系统 - RBC、HGB、HCT\n3. 血小板 - PLT\n\n这些就是主要参数。我直接总结给用户即可。","reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full","reasoning_duration_ms":4147}}}},{"updated_at":"2026-05-21T07:22:49.289Z","status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-21T07:22:49.289Z","node_role":"timeline","id":"F5893AE3-9B16-5099-9C96-C3DFBFCFD112","order_key":1000,"kind":"text","revision":1779348169288992,"payload":{"text":{"_0":"这份报告的核心参数集中在三大系统，总结如下：\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 炎症/感染指标（白细胞系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **WBC** 白细胞计数 | 5.56 | 3.5–9.5 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **NE#** 中性粒细胞计数 | 3.24 | 1.8–6.3 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **LY#** 淋巴细胞计数 | 1.95 | 1.1–3.2 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **hs-CRP** 超敏C反应蛋白 | **0.93** | 0–6 mg/L | ✅ 无炎症 |\n\n---\n\n### 🟠 贫血指标（红细胞系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **RBC** 红细胞计数 | 4.74 | 4.3–5.8 ×10¹²/L | ✅ |\n| **HGB** 血红蛋白 | 141 | 130–175 g/L | ✅ |\n| **HCT** 红细胞比积 | 41.30% | 40–50% | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 凝血指标（血小板系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **PLT** 血小板计数 | 270 | 125–350 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n**一句话总结**：三大系统全部正常，hs-CRP 仅 0.93（极低水平），确认体内无明显炎症，与\"肠功能紊乱\"诊断一致。"}}}]}],"block_updates":[]}
