Z5 42%\n恢复能力：优秀（1 分钟心率下降 35 bpm）\n\n【AI 备注】\n- 高强度负荷明显\n- 1 分钟心率恢复较好"}}},"node_role":"tool","updated_at":"2026-05-21T11:28:43.610Z","created_at":"2026-05-21T11:28:43.559Z"},{"parent_tool_call_id":"call_84uzpw5h9nxb6l5h4lwwkmsc","created_at":"2026-05-21T11:28:34.703Z","tool_call_id":"call_84uzpw5h9nxb6l5h4lwwkmsc","parent_block_id":"D75C1527-074B-5FF2-92C2-01B80BF57995","order_key":6100,"payload":{"workout_visualization":{"_0":{"schema_version":"health_workout_v1","generated_at":1779362914,"workouts":[{"average_speed_mps":0.3274106159212333,"active_energy_kcal":611.841000000001,"end":1753185567,"route":[],"activity_type_key":"badminton","start":1753181731,"elapsed_seconds":3836,"distance_meters":1255.8243760881014,"activity_type_name":"羽毛球","id":"C7F9FE87-29BB-449E-883B-FC0544BD77C6","average_heart_rate_bpm":154.73992586277342,"average_pace_min_per_km":50.90447852392253,"heart_rate_samples":[{"bpm":145.62566844547274,"timestamp":1753181752},{"bpm":150.94003313257417,"timestamp":1753182461},{"bpm":179.5030826140567,"timestamp":1753183133},{"bpm":144.0882749326146,"timestamp":1753183905},{"bpm":163.01394169835237,"timestamp":1753184604},{"bpm":127.197628458498,"timestamp":1753185355}],"events":[],"start_text":"2025年7月22日 18:55","end_text":"2025年7月22日 19:59","total_energy_kcal":611.841000000001}],"notes":[]}}},"anchor":{"value":"call_84uzpw5h9nxb6l5h4lwwkmsc","type":"toolCall"},"id":"E6F944D6-1012-54B7-BB04-39FE41183DE4","kind":"workoutVisualization","updated_at":"2026-05-21T11:28:34.703Z","node_role":"toolPresentation","revision":1779362914702927,"status":"ready"},{"id":"204EC80E-1010-5081-BCFE-2E5EF8FDCACE","status":"ready","kind":"text","revision":1779362923560710,"order_key":7000,"payload":{"text":{"_0":"## 🏃 近7天运动记录汇总\n\n### 📊 整体数据\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 运动次数 | 1次 |\n| 总时长 | 1小时3分钟 |\n| 总距离 | 1.26公里 |\n| 总消耗热量 | 612千卡 |\n\n---\n\n### 🎾 详细运动记录\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| 运动类型 | 羽毛球 |\n| 运动时间 | 2025年7月22日 18:55 |\n| 运动时长 | 1小时3分钟 |\n| 消耗热量 | 612千卡 |\n\n---\n\n### ❤️ 心率分析\n- **平均心率**：152次/分\n- **峰值心率**：180次/分\n- **心率分区**：58%处于高强度Z4区间，42%处于极限Z5区间，整体属于高强度运动\n- **恢复能力**：优秀（运动后1分钟心率下降35次/分）\n\n---\n\n### 💡 AI 运动建议\n1. 本次运动整体负荷较高，且心率恢复能力优秀，说明心肺功能良好\n2. 高强度运动占比过高，建议下次运动适当增加热身和放松环节，降低运动损伤风险\n3. 若以减脂为目标，可适当增加低强度有氧时长，将Z2-Z3区间占比提升至60%以上，燃脂效率会更优\n\n需要我帮您生成运动总结知识卡片，或查询更长时间范围的运动记录吗？"}},"node_role":"timeline","updated_at":"2026-05-21T11:28:43.561Z","created_at":"2026-05-21T11:28:43.561Z"}]}],"block_updates":[]}
